 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.131,
   "end": 4.814,
   "text": "it's a big hole in the market that people need and you found it and you're filling it."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.035,
   "end": 7.176,
   "text": "That's what a business is."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.796,
   "end": 17.683,
   "text": "I can't tell you how many people I've been talking to lately that they approach the business with what they want, what they like, who they are, but what time they spent doing this."
  },
  {
   "start": 17.943,
   "end": 21.385,
   "text": "And, you know, you've been through school to be a doctor."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.925,
   "end": 28.97,
   "text": "Like you could easily just be like, you know, you know how many years of experience I have, you know, how much stuff I went through and talk about you all the time."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.04,
   "end": 32.421,
   "text": "and let that ego inflame, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.441,
   "end": 37.262,
   "text": "But you choose to flip that on its head and serve at a high level."
  },
  {
   "start": 38.782,
   "end": 43.544,
   "text": "So it sounds like to me, you're helping doctors to become doctorpreneurs."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.704,
   "end": 45.264,
   "text": "It is."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.624,
   "end": 46.524,
   "text": "You took the words out of my mouth."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.544,
   "end": 47.425,
   "text": "That's the transformation."
  },
  {
   "start": 48.225,
   "end": 53.426,
   "text": "So the transformation is when all of us finish our training, you are a 0.1%er."
  },
  {
   "start": 56.959,
   "end": 60.302,
   "text": "It has such a unique body of knowledge and you're great at that."
  },
  {
   "start": 61.443,
   "end": 61.903,
   "text": "And guess what?"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.923,
   "end": 65.646,
   "text": "You spent so much attention and time and energy on being that 0.1%."
  },
  {
   "start": 65.666,
   "end": 66.967,
   "text": "You didn't neglect everything else."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.647,
   "end": 69.689,
   "text": "You don't know how to do that stuff usually."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.449,
   "end": 75.713,
   "text": "And in our culture of being a physician, then you got to do continuing medical education."
  },
  {
   "start": 76.073,
   "end": 78.535,
   "text": "And then you got to keep up with compliance of this and this and this."
  },
  {
   "start": 78.575,
   "end": 80.697,
   "text": "So all your energy is focused on being a doctor."
  },
  {
   "start": 81.468,
   "end": 83.657,
   "text": "So your skill set and everything else is a lot smaller."
  },
  {
   "start": 83.698,
   "end": 87.353,
   "text": "So the transformation for me was like, you know, since"
  }
 ],
